<odoo>
<record id="portal_learning_purchases" model="portal.entry"><field name="name">Achats de formation mandatés</field><field name="description">Consulter et attribuer les sièges de vos achats autorisés</field><field name="url">/my/learning-purchases</field><field name="placeholder_count">learning_purchases_count</field><field name="category">client_category</field><field name="sequence">75</field></record>
<record id="mandate_list" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">autonomous.purchase.mandate.list</field><field name="model">training.elearning.sale.mandate</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><list><field name="line_id"/><field name="user_id"/><field name="state"/><field name="can_assign"/><field name="valid_until"/><field name="company_id" groups="base.group_multi_company"/></list></field></record>
<record id="mandate_form" model="ir.ui.view"><field name="name">autonomous.purchase.mandate.form</field><field name="model">training.elearning.sale.mandate</field><field name="arch" type="xml"><form string="Mandat entreprise"><header><button name="action_grant" type="object" string="Accorder le mandat" class="btn-primary" invisible="state != 'draft'"/><button name="action_revoke" type="object" string="Révoquer immédiatement" invisible="state != 'active'"/><field name="state" widget="statusbar"/></header><sheet><group><field name="line_id" readonly="state != 'draft'" domain="[('learning_confirmed_at','!=',False),'|',('learning_channel_id','!=',False),('learning_path_id','!=',False)]"/><field name="user_id" readonly="state != 'draft'"/><field name="valid_until" readonly="state != 'draft'"/><field name="can_assign" readonly="state != 'draft'"/><field name="beneficiary_ids" widget="many2many_tags" readonly="state != 'draft'"/><field name="reason" readonly="state != 'draft'"/><field name="granted_by"/><field name="granted_at"/><field name="revocation_reason" readonly="state == 'revoked'"/><field name="revoked_by"/><field name="revoked_at"/></group><p>Le mandat porte uniquement sur cette ligne d’achat et ce compte. Aucun droit d’accès aux résultats pédagogiques ou aux autres achats n’est ajouté.</p></sheet></form></field></record>
<record id="mandate_action" model="ir.actions.act_window"><field name="name">Mandats entreprise</field><field name="res_model">training.elearning.sale.mandate</field><field name="view_mode">list,form</field></record>
<menuitem id="learning_mandates" name="Mandats entreprise" parent="training_elearning.learning_root" action="mandate_action" groups="training_elearning_sale.group_learning_sales_manager" sequence="35"/>
<template id="company_purchases" name="Mandated learning purchases"><t t-call="portal.portal_layout"><div class="container py-4"><h1>Mes achats de formation mandatés</h1><p t-if="not purchases">Aucun mandat en cours.</p><ul><li t-foreach="purchases" t-as="purchase"><a t-att-href="'/my/learning-purchases/%s' % purchase['id']"><t t-out="purchase['reference']"/> · <t t-out="purchase['offer']"/></a></li></ul></div></t></template>
<template id="company_purchase" name="Scoped enterprise learning purchase"><t t-call="portal.portal_layout"><div class="container py-4"><a href="/my/learning-purchases">Mes achats mandatés</a><h1 t-out="purchase['reference']"/><p t-out="purchase['offer']"/><p>Sièges achetés : <t t-out="purchase['quantity']"/> · Attribués : <t t-out="purchase['allocated']"/> · Disponibles : <t t-out="purchase['remaining']"/></p><p>Fuseau horaire : <t t-out="purchase['timezone']"/></p><p>Fin du mandat : <t t-out="purchase['valid_until']"/></p><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Bénéficiaire</th><th>Période financée depuis</th><th>Jusqu’au</th><th>État de l’accès financé</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr t-foreach="purchase['rows']" t-as="row"><td t-out="row['beneficiary']"/><td t-out="row['start']"/><td t-out="row['end']"/><td t-out="row['state']"/></tr></tbody></table><form t-if="purchase['assignable'] and purchase['beneficiaries']" method="post" t-att-action="'/my/learning-purchases/%s/assign' % purchase['id']"><input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/><label for="beneficiary">Bénéficiaire validé</label><select id="beneficiary" name="beneficiary" class="form-select" required="required"><option t-foreach="purchase['beneficiaries']" t-as="person" t-att-value="person['id']" t-out="person['name']"/></select><p>Les bénéficiaires proposés ont été validés par la coordination pour cet achat. Contactez-la pour préparer un autre bénéficiaire.</p><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Confirmer l’attribution</button></form><p>Les résultats détaillés et les autres formations des bénéficiaires ne sont pas accessibles dans cet espace.</p></div></t></template>
</odoo>
